Password spraying / phishing follow-up behavior using repeated failed + successful logons.

IdentityLogonEvents
| where ActionType in ("LogonFailed", "LogonSuccess")
| summarize Failed=countif(ActionType=="LogonFailed"),
            Success=countif(ActionType=="LogonSuccess")
  by AccountUpn, IPAddress, bin(Timestamp, 1h)
| where Failed > 10 and Success > 0
| order by Failed desc
